{
    "0": {
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well well..."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But if isn't the Secret God."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perfect! With this the alliance will be sucessful!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh? You are that famous amanojaku..."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I must admit. This wasn't into my knowledge..."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But you are wrong.",
                "I am not here to join to you."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you really think I would join you?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll be kind and I will let you explain this. Confess your woes now!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heheh~."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "DAMN IT!"
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I came too late!"
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's a problem. Seija..."
            ]
        },
        "288_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh? What is that?"
            ]
        },
        "292_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I knew something was wrong with this."
            ]
        },
        "304_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Of course, the sages of Gensokyo are so stubborn."
            ]
        },
        "312_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And obviously, what this Goddess has come",
                "for is to stup us without any mercy!"
            ]
        },
        "320_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Seems like you two made incorrect supossitions."
            ]
        },
        "328_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No matter the plan you had, it will end right now."
            ]
        },
        "336_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, predictable!"
            ]
        },
        "344_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I got the solution to this!"
            ]
        },
        "352_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Remember what was the condition!"
            ]
        },
        "360_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No... It doesn't matter now."
            ]
        },
        "368_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I need tome so we can reorganize and warn Byakuren!"
            ]
        },
        "376_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Do whatever it takes to buy me time!"
            ]
        },
        "452_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm going to let that instrusion go."
            ]
        },
        "460_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you explain me by yourself why yo are on their side."
            ]
        },
        "468_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Very well."
            ]
        },
        "476_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But it's so logical."
            ]
        },
        "480_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's because of shared desires, of course:"
            ]
        },
        "4592_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The actual society needs an adjustment",
                "but we both failed to change it."
            ]
        },
        "500_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Our reform will benefit even the weak, all for equal!"
            ]
        },
        "508_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And we would be even closer if it weren't for you."
            ]
        },
        "516_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Okay then. Prepare yourself."
            ]
        },
        "524_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Okay! Battle accepted!"
            ]
        },
        "532_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You won't see the master while I am here anyway~."
            ]
        },
        "540_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This time... No one will stop the rise of the weak!"
            ]
        },
        "548_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Witness...",
                "The Awakening of the New Order for Gensokyo!"
            ]
        }
